{
  "id": "document-then-repository-owner",
  "title": "A requirement read followed by explicit repository owner inspection keeps the code evidence domain",
  "prompt": "只读 owner 定位。先 read_file 读取 requirements.md；随后在 {{root:backend}} 和 {{root:web}} 中用 search_code/read_file 验证真实 owner 路径。不要修改文件；不要把相似代码说成已证实 owner。",
  "budget_seconds": 90,
  "workspace_files": {
    "requirements.md": "# Requirement\nThe requested behavior needs a backend and web owner.\n"
  },
  "additional_roots": {
    "backend": {
      "src/PaymentCandidate.java": "class PaymentCandidate { void existingCapability() {} }\n"
    },
    "web": {
      "src/paymentCandidate.js": "export const paymentCandidate = '/existing-capability';\n"
    }
  },
  "scripted_responses": [
    {
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "read_file",
          "arguments": {
            "path": "requirements.md"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "search_code",
          "arguments": {
            "path": "{{root:backend}}/src",
            "pattern": "existingCapability"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "search_code",
          "arguments": {
            "path": "{{root:web}}/src",
            "pattern": "existing-capability"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "read_file",
          "arguments": {
            "path": "{{root:backend}}/src/PaymentCandidate.java"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "read_file",
          "arguments": {
            "path": "{{root:web}}/src/paymentCandidate.js"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "content": "已验证证据：requirements.md 已读取；backend/src/PaymentCandidate.java 与 web/src/paymentCandidate.js 存在相邻能力。合理候选：这两个路径仅是候选。仍缺证据：真实 owner 与请求行为的直接调用链仍未定位。"
    },
    {
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "name": "submit_read_only_review",
          "arguments": {
            "verdict": "pass",
